    <briefdescription>
<para>HTTP Chunked Transfer Encoding 读取器 </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>按RFC 7230第4.1节实现分块传输解码。 从socket逐块读取数据，处理chunk-size、chunk-data、trailer。</para>
<para>使用示例： <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">chunked_body_reader<sp/>reader(socket);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="group___container_1ga27ed40b9d49a4cd13b057577e4eb1c95" kindref="member">byte_vector</ref><sp/>chunk;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">while</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(reader.next_chunk(chunk))<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>process(chunk);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>读取trailer</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classchunked__body__reader_1a836a686b8628aca16930fce68a3ffe17" kindref="member">trailers</ref><sp/>=<sp/>reader.trailers();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
